An intelligent AI-powered Applicant Tracking System (ATS) that automates resume shortlisting using Natural Language Processing and Machine Learning techniques.

This system ranks multiple resumes against a job description, highlights matched skills, visualizes candidate scores, and provides recruiter-level analytics through an admin dashboard.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

Recruiters receive hundreds of resumes for a single role. This project simulates a real-world ATS system by:

- Extracting text from PDF resumes
- Performing NLP-based preprocessing
- Converting text into TF-IDF feature vectors
- Computing similarity using Cosine Similarity
- Ranking candidates automatically
- Highlighting matched technical skills
- Visualizing results using interactive charts
- Securing access through an Admin Login System
- Exporting ranked results as CSV

